cff-version: 1.2.0
title: NitroSight
message: If you use this software, please cite the paper below.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/aryanpshah/nitrosight"
abstract: >-
  NitroSight assigns a Carcinogenic Potency Categorization Approach potency
  category and acceptable intake limit to a nitrosamine impurity, from a
  structure image, a SMILES string, a compound name or a CAS number, and
  reports which table of the FDA guidance produced every contributing factor.
keywords:
  - nitrosamine
  - NDSRI
  - CPCA
  - impurity assessment
  - optical chemical structure recognition
  - regulatory cheminformatics

